   "en": "There were only two men who challenged Mount Everest in winter. One was Gorou, a Japanese company employee. The other is an American called Lostman. The two men, who have conquered the world's highest peaks one after another, see a satellite floating in the void at the top of Mount Everest. Space, mankind's last unclimbed peak, is their next goal!"
